# Notely UI Implementation Plan

> **Prerequisite**: Complete ALL phases in [logic_plan.md](file:///C:/Users/KimoStore/.gemini/antigravity/brain/f5d25248-3898-4805-92db-e80cbdb0648f/logic_plan.md) first.
> **Workflow**: Follow [conductor/workflow.md](file:///d:/gemini_cli/conductor/workflow.md) UI Integration Protocol — Token Analysis → Feature Scaffolding → Atomic Widgets → Screen Composition → Logic Wiring → Routing.

---

## Design System Reference (from [product-guidelines.md](file:///d:/gemini_cli/conductor/product-guidelines.md))

| Token | Value |
|-------|-------|
| Primary | `#f9f506` (vibrant yellow) |
| Dark BG | `#23220f`, `#2f2e1a` |
| Font Display | Spline Sans |
| Font Body | Inter / Open Sans |
| Icons | Material Symbols Outlined |
| Corners | `rounded-2xl`, `rounded-full` |
| Cards | Soft shadows, blur backdrop |

---

## Phase 1: Apply Theme Tokens

Goal: Wire design tokens into existing theme system.

- [ ] Task: Update [lib/constants/app_theme.dart](file:///d:/gemini_cli/Notely/lib/constants/app_theme.dart)
  - Replace hardcoded colors with `ColorsManager` references
  - Replace inline TextStyles with `TextStyles` class
  - Ensure dark mode uses `#23220f` background
- [ ] Task: Verify existing screens render correctly
- [ ] **Acceptance**: App looks correct in both themes, no color regressions

---

## Phase 2: Auth Screens

Goal: Restyle login/register to match mockups.

### U2.1: Login Screen
- [ ] Task: Analyze [UI/login screen/screen.png](file:///d:/gemini_cli/UI/login%20screen/screen.png) for tokens
- [ ] Task: Restyle [lib/Auth_screens/loginpage.dart](file:///d:/gemini_cli/Notely/lib/Auth_screens/loginpage.dart)
  - Use `ColorsManager`, `TextStyles`, ScreenUtil sizing
  - Extract reusable form widgets to `lib/widgets/`
  - Keep [build()](file:///d:/gemini_cli/Notely/lib/page/create_update_note_view.dart#573-661) under 60 lines
- [ ] **Acceptance**: Visual match, login flow works, validation errors display

### U2.2: Register Screen
- [ ] Task: Restyle [lib/Auth_screens/registerScreen.dart](file:///d:/gemini_cli/Notely/lib/Auth_screens/registerScreen.dart)
  - Match login screen styling
- [ ] **Acceptance**: Visual match, registration works

---

## Phase 3: Home Screen

Goal: Replace [NotesView](file:///d:/gemini_cli/Notely/lib/page/note_view.dart#13-19) with new design.

- [ ] Task: Analyze [UI/homeScreen/home screen.png](file:///d:/gemini_cli/UI/homeScreen/home%20screen.png) for layout structure
- [ ] Task: Create atomic widgets in `lib/widgets/`
  - Note card widget (reusable for favorites)
  - Empty state widget
  - Search bar widget (if replacing existing)
- [ ] Task: Create new home screen (modify [lib/page/note_view.dart](file:///d:/gemini_cli/Notely/lib/page/note_view.dart) or new file)
  - Use `NoteRepository.allNotes` stream
  - Implement Loading/Empty/Error/Success states
  - FAB → `createOrUpdateNoteRoute`
  - Navigation to Settings, Account, Favourites
- [ ] Task: Update [lib/Auth_screens/accounAnalyz.dart](file:///d:/gemini_cli/Notely/lib/Auth_screens/accounAnalyz.dart) to use new screen
- [ ] **Acceptance**: Visual match, notes render, pull-to-refresh syncs, offline shows cached

