## Phase 4: Note Editor

Goal: Restyle editor while keeping FlutterQuill.

- [ ] Task: Analyze [UI/notely_editor/edit_screen.png](file:///d:/gemini_cli/UI/notely_editor/edit_screen.png)
- [ ] Task: Restyle [lib/page/create_update_note_view.dart](file:///d:/gemini_cli/Notely/lib/page/create_update_note_view.dart)
  - Keep FlutterQuill engine — style container only
  - Restyle toolbar in [lib/widgets/note_toolbar.dart](file:///d:/gemini_cli/Notely/lib/widgets/note_toolbar.dart)
  - Add favorite toggle in app bar
- [ ] **Acceptance**: Visual match, all formatting works, auto-save persists

