## Phase 5: Secondary Screens

### U5.1: Favourites Screen
- [ ] Task: Create `lib/page/favourites_screen.dart`
  - Use `NoteRepository.favoriteNotes` stream
  - Reuse note card widget from home
  - Empty state for no favorites
- [ ] Task: Register route in [lib/main.dart](file:///d:/gemini_cli/Notely/lib/main.dart)
- [ ] **Acceptance**: Visual match, shows only starred notes, toggle works

### U5.2: Settings Screen
- [ ] Task: Restyle [lib/page/setting_screen.dart](file:///d:/gemini_cli/Notely/lib/page/setting_screen.dart)
  - Theme toggle (Light/Dark/System) via `ThemeNotifier`
  - Logout triggers `AuthBloc` event
  - Persist to `shared_preferences`
- [ ] Task: Register route
- [ ] **Acceptance**: Visual match, theme changes immediately, persists on restart

### U5.3: Account Screen
- [ ] Task: Create `lib/page/account_screen.dart`
  - Display email from `AuthService.firebase().currentUser`
  - Logout option
- [ ] Task: Register route
- [ ] **Acceptance**: Visual match, correct email displayed

### U5.4: Search Screen
- [ ] Task: Create `lib/page/search_screen.dart` (or inline on home)
  - Use `NoteRepository.searchNotes()` with debounce
  - Empty state for no results
- [ ] Task: Register route if standalone
- [ ] **Acceptance**: Visual match, results in <300ms, "no results" state shows

