## Phase 6: Polish

- [ ] Task: Add fade/slide transitions between screens
- [ ] Task: Ensure all empty states have illustrations + messages
- [ ] Task: Add sync status indicator on home
- [ ] Task: Test on multiple screen sizes
- [ ] **Acceptance**: Smooth transitions, no raw errors, offline clearly indicated

