## Quality Gates (per [conductor/workflow.md](file:///d:/gemini_cli/conductor/workflow.md))

Before marking phase complete:
- [ ] All widget tests pass
- [ ] Visual match to mockup verified
- [ ] Dark mode looks native
- [ ] Responsive on various screen sizes
- [ ] No linting errors
- [ ] Accessibility basics (touch targets 44x44px)
